paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{l}
  {F = {\lim\limits_{n\rightarrow^{}\infty}\sum\limits_{i = 1}^{n}{2\pi r_{i}}\upsilon\left( r_{i} \right)\Delta r = {\int_{0}^{R}{2\pi r}}\upsilon(r)dr}} \\
  {\phantom{F} = {{\int_{0}^{R}{2\pi r}}\frac{P}{4\eta l}{({R^{2} - r^{2}})}^{}dr}} \\
  {\phantom{F} = {\frac{\pi P}{2\eta l}{\int_{0}^{R}{({R^{2}r - r^{3}})}}^{}dr = \frac{\pi P}{2\eta l}\left\lbrack {R^{2}\frac{r^{2}}{2} - \frac{r^{4}}{4}} \right\rbrack_{r = 0}^{r = R}}} \\
  {\phantom{F} = {\frac{\pi P}{2\eta l}\left\lbrack {\frac{R^{4}}{2} - \frac{R^{4}}{4}} \right\rbrack = \frac{\pi PR^{4}}{8\eta l}}}
  \end{array}$$
